  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=d10a3f&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"載入器\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available-1.20.1|1.21.1|26.1.2-ecebe6?labelColor=d10a3f&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"支援版本\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/TRzEdrndM2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1104430139275743293.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Iron431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/-Patreon-f86754?style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">一款簡潔卻帶有卡通風格暴力視覺增強模組！</span></h2>\n<p>新增血液特效、地面貼圖、資料驅動型血液類型與設定檔，以及血腥內容客戶端設定！ <img src=\"https://c10.patreonusercontent.com/4/patreon-media/p/post/161459527/87b6c1fe155541de855e6d3a863356da/eyJhIjoxLCJwIjoxfQ==/1.gif?token-hash=Nw9uFI-yyyBGB_h7VYR7D_f7mLRQx70-9KOsgfJb6uI=&token-time=1781913600\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">基於傷害的縮放</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1742/782/anvil-ezgif-com-video-to-gif-converter-gif.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">進階地面粒子效果</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1742/672/2026-06-18_10-31-46-copy-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">資料驅動型血液類型</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/iron431/simple-blood-mod/blob/master/README.md#json-format\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊此處了解如何自訂製作！</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1742/778/2026-06-18_11-59-40-png.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">相容性</span></h2>\n<p>如需提交 <a href=\"https://github.com/iron431/simple-blood-mod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">模組實體相容性請求，請點擊此處！</a><br>\n血液濺射相容於：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原版</li>\n<li>Iron's Spells 'n Spellbooks</li>\n<li>Guard Villagers</li>\n<li>Born in Chaos</li>\n<li>Ice and Fire</li>\n<li>The Aether</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">免責聲明</span></h2>\n<p>本模組亦提供「血腥內容」客戶端設定，可關閉標示為血腥的血液特效。</p>",
